'''Agent Staal''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[NEO Best of the Best (Gacha Event)|NEO Best of the Best]] gacha event. He was added to BCTW and BCKR in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]], [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]] and [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

