==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Edgemaster Staal''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
With his incredible attack rate and DPS especially against his target traits, Staal is a force to be reckoned with, similar to [[Trixi the Merc (Uber Rare Cat)|Trixi the Revenant]].

Staal has a unique Crowd-Controller role given his kit; the duration is extremely short, but is made up for the high chance to proc and insane attack rate. Against all of his traits, enemies who are easily outranged will have a hard time catching up to him thanks to his attack and debuff proc rate. His Critter niche is nothing to be brushed off, either, as his rapid attack rate makes up for the low chance, and this can be increased with Critical Combos, too. Against Aku, he is absolutely strong, being able to pierce through shields and stay safe from Death Surges many Aku enemies are notorious for, and he can definitely tank Aku enemies if they ever get close and reposition safely.

However, even with his perks, he does have weaknesses, notably the lack of Curse immunity which can greatly hinder him especially in [[Legend Stages|Uncanny Legends]] and against the likes of [[Malevolent Dark Cat]], and that his damage per hit is rather low. Despite these, he is still an incredibly valuable unit against his traits and should not be underestimated.

